    "panels": [
      {
        "text": "**AI learns from lots of training examples.**\n\nIt learns patterns that repeat across those examples.\n\nWhat it learns helps it make something new later.",
        "imageUrl": "https://images.code.org/21dc8bc583c9ef2c63d3d6f50276bcf3-codeai-scanner-learning-box-16x9.gif",
        "key": "adaptive-test-debug-panel-935f641d-7a93-44e8-81ce-6ded8f68ea2e"
      },
      {
        "text": "Training examples show different cats.\n\nTheir colors and markings vary.\n\n**AI learns shared patterns, like pointed ears.**",
        "imageUrl": "https://images.code.org/a2b43d0612d01a0b36a1af06686fb1ba-codeai-cat-pattern-grid-16x9.gif",
        "key": "adaptive-test-debug-panel-b1f698e8-6cee-47e4-9b38-59e7d8253e5b"
      },
      {
        "text": "AI uses learned patterns to make a new image.\n\nYour prompt helps guide what it makes.\n\n**But, what if some kinds of cats were missing from its training examples?**",
        "imageUrl": "https://images.code.org/dd5379f1ec65be075369af4c08a672f2-codeai-prompt-cat-noise-16x9.gif",
        "key": "adaptive-test-debug-panel-5b46df30-8529-4368-84d7-7e9d4c52c78c"
      },
      {
        "text": "###Clues to give the AI\n\n- What you see: a broken-picture icon\n- What the error says: the file name and “Not Found”\n\nThe more clues you give, the better the fix.",
        "imageUrl": "https://images.code.org/cbf8eaca3145a78c6bb9a734abb14993-Broken image, linked code clue.png",
        "key": "adaptive-test-debug-panel-7c58b191-99aa-48b8-a5a0-cb52c9832b63",
        "layout": "text-bottom-right"
      }
    ],
    "use_links": "false"
  },
